  "maps": {
    "96": {
      "name": "Pewter City Museum",
      "events": {
        "2": {
          "name": "EV002 (Shieldon/Armor fossil display at x:4,y:4)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Its armored face could deflect",
                    "almost any blow. Scientists now",
                    "study how such traits might be",
                    "passed to living Pok\u00e9mon."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "4": {
          "name": "EV004 (Scientist at x:10,y:5)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Rock-type DNA preserves better",
                    "than anything. The mineral matrix",
                    "locks genetic data in place for",
                    "eons. My lab notes? Not so much."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That preservation made fossil",
                    "revival possible. And now it's",
                    "opening doors to fusion research",
                    "that keep me up at night. Happily."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "5": {
          "name": "EV005 (Shieldon/Armor display at x:3,y:4)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Armor Fossil's structure",
                    "suggests immense resilience.",
                    "If such durability could be",
                    "combined with modern species..."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "6": {
          "name": "EV006 (Quiz Master at x:16,y:6) -- CRITICAL MECHANICAL EVENT",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hey there, trainer! I run the",
                    "museum's Pok\u00e9mon knowledge quiz.",
                    "Think you know your type matchups?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Get all three right and I'll",
                    "teach your Pok\u00e9mon a move that",
                    "could help in this town's Gym!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "12": {
          "name": "EV012 (Amaura/Sail fossil display at x:14,y:4)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Its ice-cold crest could calm",
                    "any aggressor. Researchers wonder",
                    "if such ancient traits could",
                    "enhance modern Pok\u00e9mon through",
                    "Synthesis."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "13": {
          "name": "EV013 (Paleontologist NPC at x:3,y:5)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "These two species lived millions",
                    "of years apart. They never met",
                    "in the wild."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "And yet we can revive them both",
                    "today. Nature didn't intend that.",
                    "Then again, nature didn't intend",
                    "museums either. Here we are."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "32": {
          "name": "EV032 (Awed visitor at x:13,y:9)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "A million years old! And we just",
                    "wake them up like it's nothing.",
                    "I'm terrified and amazed in",
                    "equal measure, honestly."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
